    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension is a fast-paced roguelite where skills evolve mid-run, quests shift based on your actions, and every room is unpredictable. Fuse powers, stay alive, and try not to think too hard about who's really watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Ascension you will...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fuse abilities to create new ones<br>\u2022 Explore rooms, quests, and events that shift based on your behavior<br>\u2022 Earn followers and react to a mysterious system that rewards or sabotages<br>\u2022 Uncover fragments of a hidden structure beneath the game itself</p>",
